# Deny everything, then allow only what the build needs. This keeps secrets and
# state out of the build context for good: the root `env` file, `.env*`, `*.db`,
# any `*.toml` config, `.git`, `.superpowers`, `deploy/` (including deploy/local,
# deploy/secrets and deploy/data) never reach the builder.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!LICENSE
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**
# Even inside the allowed trees, never send these.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.toml
**/.env*
**/env
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
